1
00:00:36,572 --> 00:00:37,089
Quietly!!

2
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:39,889
Kaew!

3
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:42,855
Where have you been?

4
00:00:42,892 --> 00:00:44,850
You promised you'd stay and protect me.

5
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:49,409
Do you have any idea how much I've missed you?

6
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:53,556
I've imagined all sorts of things, wondering whether you were alive or dead... whether you were safe.

7
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,153
But you never sent me any word.

8
00:00:56,570 --> 00:00:59,273
You never let me know if you were all right.

9
00:01:01,175 --> 00:01:02,203
I'm sorry...

10
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:06,080
I'm truly sorry.

11
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:10,984
I didn't have the courage to face you.

12
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:14,166
Because I feel guilty

13
00:01:16,338 --> 00:01:18,330
for failing to protect you.

14
00:01:22,129 --> 00:01:24,120
Your father drove me out of the city.

15
00:01:26,886 --> 00:01:28,880
I have no right to stand by your side...

16
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:32,264
or even remain in this city.

17
00:01:34,867 --> 00:01:36,860
Tomorrow, I must leave for good.

18
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:42,104
I've missed you.

19
00:01:42,147 --> 00:01:44,855
I've missed you so much, but there's nothing I can do.

20
00:01:45,550 --> 00:01:49,107
And to make matters worse, Khun Chai Phakdee keeps following me around all the time.

21
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:50,627
I don't like him at all.

22
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:54,073
That's exactly why I've come.

23
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:57,132
I've discovered something about him.

24
00:01:58,350 --> 00:02:01,624
He's been associating with Khun Maen—your father's sworn enemy.

25
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:11,501
Is everything okay?

26
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:13,913
Everything is okay. How about your side?

27
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,526
I never knew about this before.

28
00:02:23,130 --> 00:02:24,590
That's all I can tell you.

29
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,378
I have to go now.

30
00:02:32,650 --> 00:02:34,012
You're leaving already?

31
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,196
Don't you miss me at all?

32
00:03:19,930 --> 00:03:20,744
Of course I do.

33
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:23,883
I miss you so much.

34
00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:31,600
It's just... the closer I am to you,

35
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:35,169
the harder it is to control my heart.

36
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,692
I'm afraid I'll never be able to forget you.

37
00:03:43,690 --> 00:03:44,941
Then why should you have to forget?

38
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:47,372
I've never cared about my father.

39
00:03:47,396 --> 00:03:49,101
I've never cared about Khun Chai Phakdee.

40
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:53,021
I've never cared about anyone in this household... except you.

41
00:03:53,950 --> 00:03:55,489
And now that you've come back,

42
00:03:56,410 --> 00:03:57,932
I'm never letting you go again.

43
00:04:28,116 --> 00:04:29,538
I've missed you.

44
00:04:32,410 --> 00:04:34,012
I've missed everything about you.

45
00:04:35,610 --> 00:04:36,689
So have I.

46
00:04:59,450 --> 00:05:02,030
I've missed the gentle scent of jasmine that always lingers on you.

47
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:20,633
This is the evidence I found.

48
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,667
It's a slow-acting poison.

49
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,793
I saw him buying it at the market.

50
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,233
Do you have slow-acting poison?

51
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,261
Yes, I do.

52
00:07:43,170 --> 00:07:44,313
Do you have any more?

53
00:07:44,344 --> 00:07:45,076
Yes, I do.

54
00:07:53,690 --> 00:07:55,329
Thank you!

55
00:07:58,540 --> 00:07:59,163
Excuse me, uncle.

56
00:07:59,187 --> 00:07:59,710
Yes?

57
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:03,015
What kind of medicine did that nobleman buy just now?

58
00:08:03,046 --> 00:08:04,067
slow-acting poison

59
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,513
A slow-acting poison...

60
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:13,606
If you ever see him using it in the household, it means he intends to do harm.

61
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:19,926
You must be very careful...

62
00:08:21,852 --> 00:08:23,850
and don't trust Khun Chai Phakdee.

63
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:29,261
What about you?

64
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,901
I'll come back.

65
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,667
I'll be waiting for you.
